    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883e0113a3791f80e81711e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后——我和大进什么也没做，\r\n只是轻轻聊着天，聊着我与她相遇至今的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e14f56a4db03fa11e089f891a3dc9ed67e5f2cd7866d490693243f9eecef84f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:102f0691c7a526cf1aeee422",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从第一次见面，\r\n就被她的末脚迷住的事情开始——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a836c0ea85b073cbbdb3a0f8cf751d128c27a179aa09a701137779a66192def",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db5ce8ce2974550e0bc45ca7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再聊到一切的转折，\r\n『皋月赏』的BNW三强对决——",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f1822455bc071dbe3c527ac13b85c9f18dcf20da9ee9c48257990d964f405f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66aa02a1a606ffe9d63e6e3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及——\r\n执念的终结，『有马纪念』的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a74af9f26d0ee57a8aa01c2c34859e57be1989970efbc15bd4c28a14273c6cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2499509ae834b463f5743aa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我们都没怎么说话，\r\n但对话就这样一句没一句地进行着。\r\n不知不觉间，周围都已经暗了下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "453a66bd853f75479c0df293fb42eeb229e5ebcd75cfc25f4481e977acc376af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
